        "original_id": "e9c022e8-0bea-59be-b218-25aa1eb3ab3a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Space Ghost's Musical Bar-B-Que\n- People: Andy Merrill\n- Characters: Brak, Space Ghost, Zorak\n- Series: Space Ghost, Space Ghost Coast to Coast, Cartoon Planet\n- Companies: Hanna-Barbera, Cartoon Network\n\nFacts:\n- In 1966, Hanna-Barbera's animated series \"Space Ghost\" featured Brak as a fictional supervillain and catlike alien space pirate who tried to conquer the galaxy.\n- Andy Ronald Merrill was born on November 27, 1966, in Newark, Ohio.\n- Andy Merrill is an American television writer, producer, and voice actor best known for his comedy voice portrayal of Brak on \"Space Ghost Coast to Coast,\" \"Cartoon Planet,\" and related Cartoon Network productions using characters from the \"Space Ghost\" series.\n- \"Space Ghost's Musical Bar-B-Que\" features songs and skits by Space Ghost and his arch enemies Zorak and Brak.",
